#: about.php:29 include/global_arrays.php:2655 lib/html.php:2901
msgid "About Cacti"
msgstr "Kuhusu Cacti"

#: about.php:42
msgid "Cacti is designed to be a complete graphing solution based on the RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) and Graphing solution. Its goal is to make the Network Administrator's job easier by taking care of all the important details necessary to create meaningful Graphs."
msgstr "Cacti imeundwa kuwa suluhisho kamili la uchoraji grafu linalotegemea Hifadhidata ya Mfululizo wa Muda (TSDB) ya RRDtool na suluhisho la Uchoraji Grafu. Lengo lake ni kurahisisha kazi ya Msimamizi wa Mtandao kwa kushughulikia maelezo yote muhimu yanayohitajika kuunda Grafu zenye maana."

#: about.php:44
#, php-format
msgid "Please see the official %sCacti website%s for information on how to use Cacti, get support, and updates."
msgstr "Tafadhali tazama %stovuti rasmi ya Cacti%s kwa maelezo kuhusu jinsi ya kutumia Cacti, kupata usaidizi, na masasisho."

#: about.php:48
msgid "Active Developers"
msgstr "Wasanidi Programu Hai"

#: about.php:49
msgid "Developers working on Cacti, its Architecture, Documentation and Future Releases."
msgstr "Wasanidi programu wanaofanya kazi kwenye Cacti, Muundo wake, Nyaraka na Matoleo Yajayo."

#: about.php:61
msgid "Honorable Mentions"
msgstr "Kutajwa kwa Heshima"

#: about.php:62
msgid "Contributors to Documentation, QA, Packaging, the Forums and our YouTube page."
msgstr "Wachangiaji wa Nyaraka, QA, Ufungashaji, Mijadala na ukurasa wetu wa YouTube."

#: about.php:70
msgid "Emeritus Members"
msgstr "Wanachama Wastaafu"

#: about.php:71
msgid "Members of the original Cacti Group that have since moved on in their careers.  We continue to wish them the best."
msgstr "Wanachama wa Kundi la awali la Cacti ambao tangu wakati huo wameendelea katika kazi zao. Tunaendelea kuwatakia mema."

#: about.php:84
msgid "Thanks"
msgstr "Asante"

#: about.php:87
#, php-format
msgid "A very special thanks to %sTobi Oetiker%s, the creator of %sRRDtool%s and the very popular %sMRTG%s."
msgstr "Shukrani za pekee sana kwa %sTobi Oetiker%s, muundaji wa %sRRDtool%s na %sMRTG%s maarufu sana."

#: about.php:90
msgid "The users of Cacti"
msgstr "Watumiaji wa Cacti"

#: about.php:91
msgid "Especially anyone who has taken the time to create an issue report, or otherwise help fix a Cacti related problems. Also to anyone who has contributed to supporting Cacti."
msgstr "Hasa mtu yeyote ambaye ametenga muda kuunda ripoti ya tatizo, au kusaidia kurekebisha matatizo yanayohusiana na Cacti. Pia kwa mtu yeyote ambaye amechangia kusaidia Cacti."

#: about.php:96
msgid "License"
msgstr "Leseni"

#: about.php:98
msgid "Cacti is licensed under the GNU GPL:"
msgstr "Cacti imepewa leseni chini ya GNU GPL:"

#: about.php:102 lib/installer.php:1866
msgid "This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation; either version 2 of the License, or (at your option) any later version."
msgstr "Programu hii ni programu huria; unaweza kuisambaza tena na/au kuirekebisha chini ya masharti ya Leseni ya Umma ya GNU kama ilivyochapishwa na Free Software Foundation; ama toleo la 2 la Leseni, au (kwa chaguo lako) toleo lolote la baadaye."

#: about.php:110
msgid "This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for more details."
msgstr "Programu hii inasambazwa kwa matumaini kwamba itakuwa muhimu, lakini BILA DHAMANA YOYOTE; hata bila dhamana iliyodokezwa ya UUZAJI au UFAAJI KWA MADHUMUNI MAALUM. Tazama Leseni ya Umma ya GNU kwa maelezo zaidi."

