#: include/global_form.php:216
msgid "A useful name for this Data Storage and Polling Profile."
msgstr "Jina muhimu kwa Wasifu huu wa Kuhifadhi Data na Ukusanyaji."

#: include/global_form.php:220
msgid "New Profile"
msgstr "Wasifu Mpya"

#: include/global_form.php:224
msgid "Polling Interval"
msgstr "Muda wa Ukusanyaji"

#: include/global_form.php:225
msgid "The frequency that data will be collected from the Data Source?"
msgstr "Marudio ambayo data itakusanywa kutoka kwa Chanzo cha Data?"

#: include/global_form.php:233
msgid "How long can data be missing before RRDtool records unknown data.  Increase this value if your Data Source is unstable and you wish to carry forward old data rather than show gaps in your graphs.  This value is multiplied by the X-Files Factor to determine the actual amount of time."
msgstr "Ni muda gani data inaweza kukosekana kabla ya RRDtool kurekodi data isiyojulikana. Ongeza thamani hii ikiwa Chanzo chako cha Data si thabiti na unataka kuendeleza data ya zamani badala ya kuonyesha mapengo kwenye grafu zako. Thamani hii huzidishwa na Kipengele cha X-Files ili kubaini muda halisi."

#: include/global_form.php:240 lib/rrd.php:4779
msgid "X-Files Factor"
msgstr "Kipengele cha X-Files"

#: include/global_form.php:241
msgid "The amount of unknown data that can still be regarded as known."
msgstr "Kiasi cha data isiyojulikana ambayo bado inaweza kuchukuliwa kuwa inajulikana."

#: include/global_form.php:249
msgid "Consolidation Functions"
msgstr "Vitendaji vya Uunganishaji"

#: include/global_form.php:250 include/global_form.php:282
msgid "How data is to be entered in RRAs."
msgstr "Jinsi data itakavyoingizwa katika RRAs."

#: include/global_form.php:257
msgid "Is this the default storage profile?"
msgstr "Je, huu ndio wasifu chaguomsingi wa kuhifadhi?"

#: include/global_form.php:263
msgid "RRDfile Size (in Bytes)"
msgstr "Ukubwa wa Faili ya RRD (katika Bytes)"

#: include/global_form.php:264
msgid "Based upon the number of Rows in all RRAs and the number of Consolidation Functions selected, the size of this entire in the RRDfile."
msgstr "Kulingana na idadi ya Safu Mlalo katika RRA zote na idadi ya Vitendakazi vya Ujumuishaji vilivyochaguliwa, ukubwa wa jumla katika RRDfile."

#: include/global_form.php:286
msgid "New Profile RRA"
msgstr "RRA Mpya ya Wasifu"

#: include/global_form.php:290
msgid "Aggregation Level"
msgstr "Kiwango cha Ujumlishaji"

#: include/global_form.php:291
msgid "The number of samples required prior to filling a row in the RRA specification.  The first RRA should always have a value of 1."
msgstr "Idadi ya sampuli zinazohitajika kabla ya kujaza safu katika vipimo vya RRA. RRA ya kwanza inapaswa kuwa na thamani ya 1 kila wakati."

#: include/global_form.php:299
msgid "How many generations data is kept in the RRA."
msgstr "Ni vizazi vingapi data huhifadhiwa katika RRA."

#: include/global_form.php:307 include/global_settings.php:2729
msgid "Default Timespan"
msgstr "Kipindi Chaguomsingi"

#: include/global_form.php:308
msgid "When viewing a Graph based upon the RRA in question, the default Timespan to show for that Graph."
msgstr "Unapotazama Grafu inayotegemea RRA husika, Kipindi cha Muda chaguomsingi cha kuonyesha kwa Grafu hiyo."

#: include/global_form.php:315
msgid "Based upon the Aggregation Level, the Rows, and the Polling Interval the amount of data that will be retained in the RRA"
msgstr "Kulingana na Kiwango cha Mjumuisho, Safu Mlalo, na Kipindi cha Polling, kiasi cha data kitakachohifadhiwa katika RRA"

#: include/global_form.php:320
msgid "RRA Size (in Bytes)"
msgstr "Ukubwa wa RRA (katika Bytes)"

#: include/global_form.php:321
msgid "Based upon the number of Rows and the number of Consolidation Functions selected, the size of this RRA in the RRDfile."
msgstr "Kulingana na idadi ya Safu Mlalo na idadi ya Vitendakazi vya Ujumuishaji vilivyochaguliwa, ukubwa wa RRA hii katika RRDfile."

#: include/global_form.php:339
msgid "A useful name for this CDEF."
msgstr "Jina muhimu kwa CDEF hii."

#: include/global_form.php:359
msgid "The name of this Color."
msgstr "Jina la Rangi hii."

#: include/global_form.php:366
msgid "Hex Value"
msgstr "Thamani ya Hex"

#: include/global_form.php:367
msgid "The hex value for this color; valid range: 000000-FFFFFF."
msgstr "Thamani ya hex kwa rangi hii; masafa halali: 000000-FFFFFF."

#: include/global_form.php:375
msgid "Any named color should be read only."
msgstr "Rangi yoyote iliyopewa jina inapaswa kuwa ya kusoma tu."

#: include/global_form.php:400 include/global_form.php:466
msgid "Enter a meaningful name for this data input method."
msgstr "Ingiza jina lenye maana kwa mbinu hii ya kuingiza data."

#: include/global_form.php:407
msgid "Input Type"
msgstr "Aina ya Ingizo"

#: include/global_form.php:408
msgid "Choose the method you wish to use to collect data for this Data Input method."
msgstr "Chagua mbinu unayotaka kutumia kukusanya data kwa mbinu hii ya Kuingiza Data."

#: include/global_form.php:414
msgid "Input String"
msgstr "Mfuatano wa Ingizo"

#: include/global_form.php:415
msgid "The data that is sent to the script, which includes the complete path to the script and input sources in &lt;&gt; brackets."
msgstr "Data inayotumwa kwa hati, ambayo inajumuisha njia kamili ya hati na vyanzo vya ingizo katika mabano ya &lt;&gt;."

#: include/global_form.php:425
msgid "White List Check"
msgstr "Ukaguzi wa Orodha Iliyoidhinishwa"

#: include/global_form.php:426
msgid "The result of the Whitespace verification check for the specific Input Method.  If the Input String changes, and the Whitelist file is not update, Graphs will not be allowed to be created."
msgstr "Matokeo ya ukaguzi wa uthibitishaji wa Nafasi Tupu kwa Mbinu mahususi ya Kuingiza.  Ikiwa Mfuatano wa Ingizo utabadilika, na faili ya Whitelist haijasasishwa, Grafu hazitaruhusiwa kuundwa."

#: include/global_form.php:442 include/global_form.php:453
#, php-format
msgid "Field [%s]"
msgstr "Uga [%s]"

#: include/global_form.php:443
#, php-format
msgid "Choose the associated field from the %s field."
msgstr "Chagua uga unaohusishwa kutoka kwenye uga wa %s."

#: include/global_form.php:454
#, php-format
msgid "Enter a name for this %s field.  Note: If using name value pairs in your script, for example: NAME:VALUE, it is important that the name match your output field name identically to the script output name or names."
msgstr "Ingiza jina la uga huu wa %s. Kumbuka: Ikiwa unatumia jozi za jina na thamani katika hati yako, kwa mfano: NAME:VALUE, ni muhimu kwamba jina lilingane sawa kabisa na jina au majina ya uga wa towe la hati yako."

#: include/global_form.php:473
msgid "Update RRDfile"
msgstr "Sasisha RRDfile"

#: include/global_form.php:474
msgid "Whether data from this output field is to be entered into the RRDfile."
msgstr "Ikiwa data kutoka sehemu hii ya towe inapaswa kuingizwa kwenye RRDfile."

#: include/global_form.php:481
msgid "Regular Expression Match"
msgstr "Upatanisho wa Semi za Kawaida (Regular Expression)"

#: include/global_form.php:482
msgid "If you want to require a certain regular expression to be matched against input data, enter it here (preg_match format)."
msgstr "Ikiwa unataka kuhitaji usemi fulani wa kawaida ulinganishwe dhidi ya data ya ingizo, uingize hapa (umbizo la preg_match)."

#: include/global_form.php:489
msgid "Allow Empty Input"
msgstr "Ruhusu Ingizo Tupu"

#: include/global_form.php:490
msgid "Check here if you want to allow NULL input in this field from the user."
msgstr "Weka tiki hapa ikiwa unataka kuruhusu ingizo la NULL katika uga huu kutoka kwa mtumiaji."

#: include/global_form.php:497
msgid "Special Type Code"
msgstr "Msimbo wa Aina Maalum"

#: include/global_form.php:498
#, php-format
msgid "If this field should be treated specially by host templates, indicate so here. Valid keywords for this field are %s"
msgstr "Ikiwa uga huu unapaswa kushughulikiwa kipekee na violezo vya kipangishi, onyesha hivyo hapa. Maneno muhimu halali kwa uga huu ni %s"

#: include/global_form.php:530
msgid "The name given to this data template."
msgstr "Jina lililopewa kiolezo hiki cha data."

#: include/global_form.php:571
msgid "Choose a name for this data source.  It can include replacement variables such as |host_description| or |query_fieldName|.  For a complete list of supported replacement tags, please see the Cacti documentation."
msgstr "Chagua jina la chanzo hiki cha data. Linaweza kujumuisha vigezo mbadala kama vile |host_description| au |query_fieldName|. Kwa orodha kamili ya lebo mbadala zinazoungwa mkono, tafadhali angalia nyaraka za Cacti."

#: include/global_form.php:575
msgid "Data Source Path"
msgstr "Njia ya Chanzo cha Data"

#: include/global_form.php:580
msgid "The full path to the RRDfile."
msgstr "Njia kamili ya RRDfile."

#: include/global_form.php:589
msgid "The script/source used to gather data for this data source."
msgstr "Hati/chanzo kinachotumika kukusanya data kwa chanzo hiki cha data."

#: include/global_form.php:595 include/global_form.php:1702
#: package_import.php:899
msgid "Select the Data Source Profile.  The Data Source Profile controls polling interval, the data aggregation, and retention policy for the resulting Data Sources."
msgstr "Chagua Wasifu wa Chanzo cha Data.  Wasifu wa Chanzo cha Data hudhibiti muda wa kukusanya data, uunganishaji wa data, na sera ya uhifadhi kwa Vyanzo vya Data vinavyotokana."

#: include/global_form.php:606
msgid "The amount of time in seconds between expected updates."
msgstr "Kiasi cha muda kwa sekunde kati ya masasisho yanayotarajiwa."

#: include/global_form.php:610
msgid "Data Source Active"
msgstr "Chanzo cha Data Kinatumika"

#: include/global_form.php:614
msgid "Whether Cacti should gather data for this data source or not."
msgstr "Ikiwa Cacti inapaswa kukusanya data kwa chanzo hiki cha data au la."

#: include/global_form.php:622
msgid "Internal Data Source Name"
msgstr "Jina la Ndani la Chanzo cha Data"

#: include/global_form.php:627
msgid "Choose unique name to represent this piece of data inside of the RRDfile."
msgstr "Chagua jina la kipekee la kuwakilisha kipande hiki cha data ndani ya RRDfile."

#: include/global_form.php:630
msgid "Minimum Value (\"U\" for No Minimum)"
msgstr "Thamani ya Chini Zaidi (\"U\" kwa Hakuna Kiwango cha Chini)"

#: include/global_form.php:635
msgid "The minimum value of data that is allowed to be collected."
msgstr "Thamani ya chini kabisa ya data inayoruhusiwa kukusanywa."

#: include/global_form.php:638
msgid "Maximum Value (\"U\" for No Maximum)"
msgstr "Thamani ya Juu Zaidi (\"U\" kwa Hakuna Kiwango cha Juu)"

#: include/global_form.php:643
msgid "The maximum value of data that is allowed to be collected."
msgstr "Thamani ya juu zaidi ya data inayoruhusiwa kukusanywa."

#: include/global_form.php:646
msgid "Data Source Type"
msgstr "Aina ya Chanzo cha Data"

#: include/global_form.php:650
msgid "How data is represented in the RRA."
msgstr "Jinsi data inavyowakilishwa katika RRA."

#: include/global_form.php:658
msgid "The maximum amount of time that can pass before data is entered as 'unknown'. (Usually 2x300=600)"
msgstr "Kiwango cha juu cha muda kinachoweza kupita kabla data haijaingizwa kama 'haijulikani'. (Kwa kawaida 2x300=600)"

#: include/global_form.php:664 lib/html_utility.php:341
msgid "Not Selected"
msgstr "Haijachaguliwa"

#: include/global_form.php:665
msgid "When data is gathered, the data for this field will be put into this data source."
msgstr "Data inapokusanywa, data ya sehemu hii itawekwa kwenye chanzo hiki cha data."

#: include/global_form.php:674
msgid "Enter a name for this GPRINT preset, make sure it is something you recognize."
msgstr "Ingiza jina la mpangilio awali huu wa GPRINT, hakikisha ni kitu unachokitambua."

#: include/global_form.php:681
msgid "GPRINT Text"
msgstr "Maandishi ya GPRINT"

#: include/global_form.php:682
msgid "Enter the custom GPRINT string here."
msgstr "Ingiza mfuatano maalum wa GPRINT hapa."

#: include/global_form.php:700
msgid "Common Options"
msgstr "Chaguo za Kawaida"

#: include/global_form.php:705
msgid "Title (--title)"
msgstr "Kichwa (--title)"

#: include/global_form.php:709
msgid "The name that is printed on the graph.  It can include replacement variables such as |host_description| or |query_fieldName|.  For a complete list of supported replacement tags, please see the Cacti documentation."
msgstr "Jina linalochapishwa kwenye grafu.  Linaweza kujumuisha vigezo vya kubadilisha kama vile |host_description| au |query_fieldName|.  Kwa orodha kamili ya lebo za kubadilisha zinazotumika, tafadhali tazama nyaraka za Cacti."

#: include/global_form.php:713
msgid "Vertical Label (--vertical-label)"
msgstr "Lebo ya Wima (--vertical-label)"

#: include/global_form.php:717
msgid "The label vertically printed to the left of the graph."
msgstr "Lebo iliyochapishwa wima upande wa kushoto wa grafu."

#: include/global_form.php:721
msgid "Image Format (--imgformat)"
msgstr "Umbizo la Picha (--imgformat)"

#: include/global_form.php:725
msgid "The type of graph that is generated; PNG, GIF or SVG.  The selection of graph image type is very RRDtool dependent."
msgstr "Aina ya grafu inayozalishwa; PNG, GIF au SVG.  Uteuzi wa aina ya picha ya grafu unategemea sana RRDtool."

#: include/global_form.php:728
msgid "Height (--height)"
msgstr "Kimo (--height)"

#: include/global_form.php:732
msgid "The height (in pixels) of the graph area within the graph. This area does not include the legend, axis legends, or title."
msgstr "Kimo (kwa pikseli) cha eneo la grafu ndani ya grafu. Eneo hili halijumuishi maelezo ya grafu, maelezo ya mhimili, au kichwa."

#: include/global_form.php:736
msgid "Width (--width)"
msgstr "Upana (--width)"

#: include/global_form.php:740
msgid "The width (in pixels) of the graph area within the graph. This area does not include the legend, axis legends, or title."
msgstr "Upana (kwa pikseli) wa eneo la grafu ndani ya grafu. Eneo hili halijumuishi maelezo ya grafu, maelezo ya mhimili, au kichwa."

#: include/global_form.php:744
msgid "Base Value (--base)"
msgstr "Thamani ya Msingi (--base)"

#: include/global_form.php:748
msgid "Should be set to 1024 for memory and 1000 for traffic measurements."
msgstr "Inapaswa kuwekwa kuwa 1024 kwa kumbukumbu na 1000 kwa vipimo vya trafiki."

#: include/global_form.php:752
msgid "Slope Mode (--slope-mode)"
msgstr "Hali ya Mteremko (--slope-mode)"

#: include/global_form.php:756
msgid "Using Slope Mode evens out the shape of the graphs at the expense of some on screen resolution."
msgstr "Kutumia Hali ya Mteremko husawazisha umbo la grafu kwa kupunguza kidogo ubora wa picha kwenye skrini."

#: include/global_form.php:759
msgid "Scaling Options"
msgstr "Chaguo za Kipimo"

#: include/global_form.php:764
msgid "Auto Scale"
msgstr "Kipimo Otomatiki"

#: include/global_form.php:768
msgid "Auto scale the y-axis instead of defining an upper and lower limit. Note: if this is check both the Upper and Lower limit will be ignored."
msgstr "Pima kiotomatiki mhimili wa y badala ya kufafanua kikomo cha juu na cha chini. Kumbuka: ikiwa hii imetiwa tiki, vikomo vya Juu na Chini vyote vitapuuzwa."

#: include/global_form.php:772
msgid "Auto Scale Options"
msgstr "Chaguo za Kipimo Otomatiki"

#: include/global_form.php:775
msgid "Use <br> --alt-autoscale to scale to the absolute minimum and maximum <br> --alt-autoscale-max to scale to the maximum value, using a given lower limit <br> --alt-autoscale-min to scale to the minimum value, using a given upper limit <br> --alt-autoscale (with limits) to scale using both lower and upper limits (RRDtool default) <br>"
msgstr "Tumia <br> --alt-autoscale kupima hadi kiwango cha chini kabisa na cha juu kabisa <br> --alt-autoscale-max kupima hadi thamani ya juu zaidi, ukitumia kikomo cha chini kilichotolewa <br> --alt-autoscale-min kupima hadi thamani ya chini kabisa, ukitumia kikomo cha juu kilichotolewa <br> --alt-autoscale (yenye vikomo) kupima ukitumia vikomo vya chini na vya juu (chaguo-msingi la RRDtool) <br>"

#: include/global_form.php:779
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale (ignoring given limits)"
msgstr "Tumia --alt-autoscale (ikipuuza vikomo vilivyotolewa)"

#: include/global_form.php:783
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale-max (accepting a lower limit)"
msgstr "Tumia --alt-autoscale-max (ikikubali kikomo cha chini)"

#: include/global_form.php:787
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale-min (accepting an upper limit)"
msgstr "Tumia --alt-autoscale-min (ikikubali kikomo cha juu)"

#: include/global_form.php:791
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale (accepting both limits, RRDtool default)"
msgstr "Tumia --alt-autoscale (ikikubali vikomo vyote viwili, chaguo-msingi la RRDtool)"

#: include/global_form.php:796
msgid "Logarithmic Scaling (--logarithmic)"
msgstr "Kipimo cha Logaritimi (--logarithmic)"

#: include/global_form.php:800
msgid "Use Logarithmic y-axis scaling"
msgstr "Tumia kipimo cha Logarithmic kwenye mhimili wa y"

#: include/global_form.php:803
msgid "SI Units for Logarithmic Scaling (--units=si)"
msgstr "Vipimo vya SI kwa Kipimo cha Logarithmic (--units=si)"

#: include/global_form.php:806
msgid "Use SI Units for Logarithmic Scaling instead of using exponential notation.<br> Note: Linear graphs use SI notation by default."
msgstr "Tumia Vipimo vya SI kwa Kipimo cha Logarithmic badala ya kutumia nukuu ya kipeo.<br> Kumbuka: Grafu za mstari hutumia nukuu ya SI kwa chaguo-msingi."

#: include/global_form.php:809
msgid "Rigid Boundaries Mode (--rigid)"
msgstr "Hali ya Mipaka Migumu (--rigid)"

#: include/global_form.php:812
msgid "Do not expand the lower and upper limit if the graph contains a value outside the valid range."
msgstr "Usipanue kikomo cha chini na cha juu ikiwa grafu ina thamani nje ya masafa halali."

#: include/global_form.php:815
msgid "Upper Limit (--upper-limit)"
msgstr "Kikomo cha Juu (--upper-limit)"

#: include/global_form.php:819
msgid "The maximum vertical value for the graph."
msgstr "Thamani ya juu zaidi ya wima kwa grafu."

#: include/global_form.php:823
msgid "Lower Limit (--lower-limit)"
msgstr "Kikomo cha Chini (--lower-limit)"

#: include/global_form.php:827
msgid "The minimum vertical value for the graph."
msgstr "Thamani ya chini kabisa ya wima kwa grafu."

#: include/global_form.php:831
msgid "Grid Options"
msgstr "Chaguo za Gridi"

#: include/global_form.php:836
msgid "Unit Grid Value (--unit/--y-grid)"
msgstr "Thamani ya Gridi ya Kipimo (--unit/--y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php:840
msgid "Sets the exponent value on the Y-axis for numbers. Note: This option is deprecated and replaced by the --y-grid option.  In this option, Y-axis grid lines appear at each grid step interval.  Labels are placed every label factor lines."
msgstr "Huweka thamani ya kipeo kwenye mhimili wa Y kwa namba. Kumbuka: Chaguo hili limepitwa na wakati na kubadilishwa na chaguo la --y-grid.  Katika chaguo hili, mistari ya gridi ya mhimili wa Y huonekana katika kila muda wa hatua ya gridi.  Lebo huwekwa kila mistari ya kipengele cha lebo."

#: include/global_form.php:844
msgid "Unit Exponent Value (--units-exponent)"
msgstr "Thamani ya Kipeo cha Kipimo (--units-exponent)"

#: include/global_form.php:848
msgid "What unit Cacti should use on the Y-axis. Use 3 to display everything in \"k\" or -6 to display everything in \"u\" (micro)."
msgstr "Kipimo gani Cacti inapaswa kutumia kwenye mhimili wa Y. Tumia 3 kuonyesha kila kitu katika \"k\" au -6 kuonyesha kila kitu katika \"u\" (micro)."

#: include/global_form.php:852
msgid "Unit Length (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"
msgstr "Urefu wa Kipimo (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php:857
msgid "How many digits should RRDtool assume the y-axis labels to be? You may have to use this option to make enough space once you start fiddling with the y-axis labeling."
msgstr "Ni tarakimu ngapi RRDtool inapaswa kudhani lebo za mhimili wa y kuwa nazo? Huenda ukahitaji kutumia chaguo hili kutengeneza nafasi ya kutosha mara tu unapoanza kurekebisha lebo za mhimili wa y."

#: include/global_form.php:860
msgid "No Gridfit (--no-gridfit)"
msgstr "Hakuna Gridfit (--no-gridfit)"

#: include/global_form.php:863
msgid "In order to avoid anti-aliasing blurring effects RRDtool snaps points to device resolution pixels, this results in a crisper appearance. If this is not to your liking, you can use this switch to turn this behavior off.<br><strong>Note: </strong>Gridfitting is turned off for PDF, EPS, SVG output by default."
msgstr "Ili kuepuka athari za ukungu za anti-aliasing, RRDtool huambatanisha pointi kwenye pikseli za ubora wa kifaa, hii inaleta mwonekano mkali zaidi. Ikiwa hii si kwa mapenzi yako, unaweza kutumia swichi hii kuzima tabia hii.<br><strong>Kumbuka: </strong>Gridfitting imezimwa kwa towe la PDF, EPS, SVG kwa chaguomsingi."

#: include/global_form.php:866
msgid "Alternative Y Grid (--alt-y-grid)"
msgstr "Gridi Mbadala ya Y (--alt-y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php:869
msgid "The algorithm ensures that you always have a grid, that there are enough but not too many grid lines, and that the grid is metric. This parameter will also ensure that you get enough decimals displayed even if your graph goes from 69.998 to 70.001.<br><strong>Note: </strong>This parameter may interfere with --alt-autoscale options."
msgstr "Kanuni hii inahakikisha kuwa kila wakati una gridi, kwamba kuna mistari ya gridi ya kutosha lakini si mingi mno, na kwamba gridi ni ya kipimo cha metriki. Kigezo hiki pia kitahakikisha unapata desimali za kutosha zinazoonyeshwa hata kama grafu yako inatoka 69.998 hadi 70.001.<br><strong>Kumbuka: </strong>Kigezo hiki kinaweza kuingilia kati chaguo za --alt-autoscale."

#: include/global_form.php:872
msgid "Axis Options"
msgstr "Chaguo za Mhimili"

#: include/global_form.php:877
msgid "Right Axis (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"
msgstr "Mhimili wa Kulia (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php:882
msgid "A second axis will be drawn to the right of the graph. It is tied to the left axis via the scale and shift parameters."
msgstr "Mhimili wa pili utachorwa upande wa kulia wa grafu. Umeunganishwa na mhimili wa kushoto kupitia vigezo vya kipimo na usogeaji."

#: include/global_form.php:885
msgid "Right Axis Label (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"
msgstr "Lebo ya Mhimili wa Kulia (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php:890
msgid "The label for the right axis."
msgstr "Lebo ya mhimili wa kulia."

#: include/global_form.php:893
msgid "Right Axis Format (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"
msgstr "Umbizo la Mhimili wa Kulia (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php:898
#, php-format
msgid "By default, the format of the axis labels gets determined automatically.  If you want to do this yourself, use this option with the same %lf arguments you know from the PRINT and GPRINT commands."
msgstr "Kwa chaguomsingi, umbizo la lebo za mhimili huamuliwa kiotomatiki. Ikiwa unataka kufanya hivi mwenyewe, tumia chaguo hili na hoja zilezile za %lf unazozijua kutoka kwa amri za PRINT na GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php:901
msgid "Right Axis Formatter (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Kiundaji Umbizo cha Mhimili wa Kulia (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php:906
msgid "When you setup the right axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length and --right-axis-format.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Unapoweka lebo za mhimili wa kulia, tumia kanuni kwa umbizo la data.  Maumbizo yanayoauniwa ni pamoja na \"numeric\" ambapo data inachukuliwa kama namba, \"timestamp\" ambapo thamani zinatafsiriwa kama mihuri ya muda ya UNIX (idadi ya sekunde tangu Januari 1970) na kuonyeshwa kwa kutumia umbizo la strftime (chaguo-msingi ni \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  Tazama pia --units-length na --right-axis-format.  Mwisho \"duration\" ambapo thamani zinatafsiriwa kama muda kwa milisekunde.  Uumbizaji hufuata kanuni za PRINT/GPRINT zilizohitimu na valstrfduration."

#: include/global_form.php:909
msgid "Left Axis Formatter (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Kiumbizo cha Mhimili wa Kushoto (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php:914
msgid "When you setup the left axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Unapoweka lebo za mhimili wa kushoto, tumia kanuni kwa umbizo la data.  Maumbizo yanayoauniwa ni pamoja na \"numeric\" ambapo data inachukuliwa kama namba, \"timestamp\" ambapo thamani zinatafsiriwa kama mihuri ya muda ya UNIX (idadi ya sekunde tangu Januari 1970) na kuonyeshwa kwa kutumia umbizo la strftime (chaguo-msingi ni \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  Tazama pia --units-length.  Mwisho \"duration\" ambapo thamani zinatafsiriwa kama muda kwa milisekunde.  Uumbizaji hufuata kanuni za PRINT/GPRINT zilizohitimu na valstrfduration."

