msgid "Legend Options"
msgstr "Chaguo za Maelezo ya Grafu"

#: include/global_form.php:922
msgid "Auto Padding"
msgstr "Uwekaji Nafasi Otomatiki"

#: include/global_form.php:926
msgid "Pad text so that legend and graph data always line up. Note: this could cause graphs to take longer to render because of the larger overhead. Also Auto Padding may not be accurate on all types of graphs, consistent labeling usually helps."
msgstr "Ongeza nafasi kwenye maandishi ili maelezo ya grafu na data ya grafu zilingane kila wakati. Kumbuka: hii inaweza kusababisha grafu kuchukua muda mrefu kuchorwa kwa sababu ya mzigo mkubwa zaidi. Pia Upangaji Kiotomatiki huenda usiwe sahihi kwa aina zote za grafu, uwekaji lebo thabiti husaidia kwa kawaida."

