msgstr "Jaribu Vyanzo vya Data"

#: include/global_form.php:1123
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Weka tiki kwenye kisanduku hiki ikiwa unataka kujaribu Vyanzo vya Data kabla ya kuviunda. Kujaribu Vyanzo vya Data kukiwezeshwa, ikiwa Chanzo cha Data hakirejeshi data halali, Grafu haitaundwa. Mpangilio huu ni muhimu ikiwa unataka kuwa na Kiolezo cha Kifaa cha jumla zaidi ambacho kinaweza kujumuisha Violezo vingi vya Grafu vinavyoweza kutumika kwa kuchagua kulingana na sifa za Kifaa chenyewe. Kumbuka: Ikiwa una hati inayochukua muda mrefu kama Chanzo cha Data, muda wa kuunda Grafu utaongezeka."

