msgid "If Cacti can not determine the interface speed due to either ifSpeed or ifHighSpeed not being set or being zero, what maximum value do you wish on the resulting RRDfiles."
msgstr "Ikiwa Cacti haiwezi kubaini kasi ya kiolesura kutokana na ifSpeed au ifHighSpeed kutokuwa imewekwa au kuwa sifuri, ni thamani gani ya juu zaidi unayotaka kwenye RRDfiles zinazotokana."

