msgstr "Mipangilio ya Muda wa Kuisha wa Mandharinyuma na Michakato Sambamba"

#: include/global_settings.php:1376
msgid "Report Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Muda wa Kusubiri wa Uundaji wa Ripoti"

