msgstr "Muda wa Kusubiri wa RRDChecker"

#: include/global_settings.php:1405
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's RRDfile check script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Kiwango cha juu cha muda ambao hati ya ukaguzi wa RRDfile ya Cacti inaweza kuendeshwa bila kutoa hitilafu ya kuisha muda na kuuawa."

