#: index.php:89
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> You are logged into a Remote Data Collector.  When <b>'online'</b>, you will be able to view and control much of the Main Cacti Web Site just as if you were logged into it.  Also, it's important to note that Remote Data Collectors are required to use the Cacti's Performance Boosting Services <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> feature, and we always recommend using Spine.  When the Remote Data Collector is <b>'offline'</b>, the Remote Data Collectors Web Site will contain much less information.  However, it will cache all updates until the Main Cacti Database and Web Server are reachable.  Then it will dump it's Boost table output back to the Main Cacti Database for updating."
msgstr "<strong>KUMBUKA:</strong> Umeingia kwenye Kikusanya Data cha Mbali. Kikiwa <b>'mtandaoni'</b>, utaweza kutazama na kudhibiti sehemu kubwa ya Tovuti Kuu ya Cacti kana kwamba umeingia humo moja kwa moja. Pia, ni muhimu kutambua kwamba Wakusanyaji Data wa Mbali wanahitajika kutumia kipengele cha Huduma za Kuboresha Utendakazi za Cacti cha <b>'Usasishaji Unapohitajika'</b>, na tunapendekeza kila wakati kutumia Spine. Wakati Kikusanya Data cha Mbali kikiwa <b>'nje ya mtandao'</b>, Tovuti ya Kikusanya Data cha Mbali itakuwa na maelezo machache zaidi. Hata hivyo, itahifadhi masasisho yote kwa muda hadi Hifadhidata Kuu ya Cacti na Seva ya Wavuti zipatikane. Kisha itatuma towe lake la jedwali la Boost kurudi kwenye Hifadhidata Kuu ya Cacti kwa ajili ya usasishaji."

#: index.php:94
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> None of the Core Cacti Plugins, to date, have been re-designed to work with Remote Data Collectors.  Therefore, Plugins such as MacTrack, and HMIB, which require direct access to devices will not work with Remote Data Collectors at this time.  However, plugins such as Thold will work so long as the Remote Data Collector is in <b>'online'</b> mode."
msgstr "<strong>KUMBUKA:</strong> Hakuna Programu-jalizi za Msingi za Cacti, hadi sasa, ambazo zimeundwa upya kufanya kazi na Wakusanyaji Data wa Mbali. Kwa hivyo, Programu-jalizi kama vile MacTrack na HMIB, ambazo zinahitaji ufikiaji wa moja kwa moja kwa vifaa hazitafanya kazi na Wakusanyaji Data wa Mbali kwa wakati huu. Hata hivyo, programu-jalizi kama vile Thold zitafanya kazi mradi Kikusanya Data cha Mbali kiko katika hali ya <b>'mtandaoni'</b>."

