msgstr "Thamani iliyobainishwa inaonekana kuwa tofauti katika usanidi unaoendeshwa dhidi ya faili ya INI."

#: lib/installer.php:2045
msgid "PHP - Module Support (Required)"
msgstr "PHP - Usaidizi wa Moduli (Inahitajika)"

#: lib/installer.php:2046
msgid "Cacti requires several PHP Modules to be installed to work properly. If any of these are not installed, you will be unable to continue the installation until corrected. In addition, for optimal system performance Cacti should be run with certain MySQL system variables set.  Please follow the MySQL recommendations at your discretion.  Always seek the MySQL documentation if you have any questions."
msgstr "Cacti inahitaji Moduli kadhaa za PHP zisakinishwe ili kufanya kazi ipasavyo. Ikiwa yoyote kati ya hizi haijasakinishwa, hutaweza kuendelea na usakinishaji hadi irekebishwe. Aidha, kwa utendakazi bora wa mfumo Cacti inapaswa kuendeshwa ikiwa na vigezo fulani vya mfumo wa MySQL vimewekwa. Tafadhali fuata mapendekezo ya MySQL kwa hiari yako. Tafuta nyaraka za MySQL kila wakati ikiwa una maswali yoyote."

#: lib/installer.php:2048
msgid "The following PHP extensions are mandatory, and MUST be installed before continuing your Cacti install."
msgstr "Viendelezi vifuatavyo vya PHP ni vya lazima, na NI LAZIMA visakinishwe kabla ya kuendelea na usakinishaji wako wa Cacti."

#: lib/installer.php:2052
msgid "Required PHP Modules"
msgstr "Moduli za PHP Zinazohitajika"

