#: user_domains.php:505
msgid "Mode which cacti will attempt to authenticate against the LDAP server.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - No Distinguished Name (DN) searching occurs, just attempt to bind with the provided Distinguished Name (DN) format.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via anonymous binding to locate the users Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Attempts search for username against LDAP directory via Specific Distinguished Name (DN) and Specific Password for binding to locate the users Distinguished Name (DN)."
msgstr "Hali ambayo Cacti itajaribu kuthibitisha dhidi ya seva ya LDAP.<blockquote><i>Hakuna Utafutaji</i> - Hakuna utafutaji wa Distinguished Name (DN) unaotokea, jaribu tu kuunganisha (bind) na umbizo la Distinguished Name (DN) lililotolewa.<br><br><i>Utafutaji Bila Utambulisho</i> - Hujaribu kutafuta jina la mtumiaji dhidi ya saraka ya LDAP kupitia kuunganisha bila utambulisho ili kupata Distinguished Name (DN) ya watumiaji.<br><br><i>Utafutaji Maalum</i> - Hujaribu kutafuta jina la mtumiaji dhidi ya saraka ya LDAP kupitia Distinguished Name (DN) Maalum na Nenosiri Maalum kwa ajili ya kuunganisha ili kupata Distinguished Name (DN) ya watumiaji."

#: user_domains.php:555
msgid "Search base for searching the LDAP directory, such as <i>\"dc=win2kdomain,dc=local\"</i> or <i>\"ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>."
msgstr "Msingi wa utafutaji wa kutafuta saraka ya LDAP, kama vile <i>\"dc=win2kdomain,dc=local\"</i> au <i>\"ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>."

#: user_domains.php:562
msgid "Search filter to use to locate the user in the LDAP directory, such as for windows: <i>\"(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))\"</i> or for OpenLDAP: <i>\"(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))\"</i>.  \"&lt;username&gt\" is replaced with the username that was supplied at the login prompt."
msgstr "Kichujio cha utafutaji cha kutumia kumpata mtumiaji kwenye saraka ya LDAP, kama vile kwa windows: <i>\"(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))\"</i> au kwa OpenLDAP: <i>\"(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))\"</i>.  \"&lt;username&gt\" inabadilishwa na jina la mtumiaji lililotolewa kwenye kidokezo cha kuingia."

